    /// Each is one of the client's own CR_* creature actions for the family at the argument the client
    /// keys by tier (1 for the rank and file, 3 for a lieutenant where the action has one), with the
    /// client's range, reuse and windup; or, for the rank and file's guns, the weapon pair the fork's
    /// existing rows use. Damage is the client's base at that argument scaled by level as the server
    /// scales abilities (x2 every 8 levels) and multiplied by 0.25, which puts a minion's hit at 4-5% of
    /// a same-level player's base health - where the fork's Thrax, Hunter and Filcher rows already sit.
    /// Weapon pairs have no base in the client and are set straight to that share (4% / 6% / 8%).
    /// Generated by gen_world_spawns.py; world_creature_actions.csv has each row with its source.
    /// </summary>
